[h1]Alletiders Nisse[/h1]
A fan remake of [b]Alletiders Nisse[/b], the Pyrus Christmas calendar CD-ROM, as a Garry's Mod gamemode – in Danish and English.
[i]En fan-genindspilning af Pyrus' julekalender – på dansk og engelsk.[/i]

Open a door in the calendar every day in December, play the day's game, earn pebernødder and decorate the tree with what you buy in Pyntekassen. The seasons are open all year.

[h2]What's in it[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The Christmas calendar[/b] – all 24 door games, with the original voices, music and sound
[*][b]Two looks[/b] – a modern interface, or [i]classic[/i], like the CD-ROM
[*][b]Pyntekassen and the Scrapbog[/b] – decorations, pictures, trophies and highscores
[*][b]Summer holiday[/b] – Surfing, Is-tårnet, Fiskekonkurrencen and Sandslottet
[*][b]Halloween[/b] – Græskarskæring, Spøgelsesjagt, Slik eller ballade and Spøgelseslabyrinten
[*][b]Easy, Normal and Hard[/b], with highscores and bronze, silver and gold trophies
[*][b]Duel[/b] – two players on one keyboard, split screen
[*][b]Kapløb[/b] – race your friends when you host it on a server
[/list]

[h2]How to play[/h2]
Subscribe, pick [b]Pyrus - Alletiders Nisse[/b] in the gamemode list in the bottom right corner of the main menu, and start a game on any map.

Also playable in the browser at [url=https://pyrus.lol]pyrus.lol[/url] – the source is on [url=https://github.com/MightyX3N/pyrus]GitHub[/url].

[i]Alletiders Nisse and Pyrus belong to their original creators. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by them.[/i]
